<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= flow ? "Editar" : "Nuevo" %> flujo guiado | Margarita</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= `/css/style.css${typeof assetVersion !== "undefined" && assetVersion ? `?v=${assetVersion}` : ""}` %>" />
    <%- include("../../../partials/brand-head") %>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-100">
    <%- include("../../../partials/admin-nav", { user }) %>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6">
        <div class="mb-6">
            <a href="/admin/ai/guided-flows" class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">← Flujos guiados</a>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800">
                <%= flow ? "Editar flujo guiado" : "Nuevo flujo guiado" %>
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
                No usa IA. Cada paso se ejecuta en orden y las respuestas de botón deciden la rama.
            </p>
        </div>

        <% if (error) { %>
            <div class="mb-5 rounded-xl bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-700"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>

        <form action="<%= flow ? `/admin/ai/guided-flows/${flow.id}` : "/admin/ai/guided-flows" %>" method="POST" class="space-y-5">
            <section class="card grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                    <label class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Nombre</label>
                    <input name="name" value="<%= values.name %>" required maxlength="80" class="input mt-1" />
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Slug</label>
                    <input name="slug" value="<%= values.slug %>" maxlength="60" class="input mt-1" placeholder="pension-imss" />
                </div>
                <div class="sm:col-span-2">
                    <label class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Dispara cuando el mensaje contiene</label>
                    <input name="trigger" value="<%= values.trigger %>" required maxlength="200" class="input mt-1" placeholder="pension|jubilado|ley 73" />
                    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Separa alternativas con <code>|</code>.</p>
                </div>
                <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 sm:col-span-2">
                    <input type="checkbox" name="isActive" <%= values.isActive ? "checked" : "" %> />
                    Activo
                </label>
            </section>

            <section class="card">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                    <label class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Pasos (JSON)</label>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Máximo 40 pasos, 3 botones por pregunta.</span>
                </div>

                <textarea name="steps" rows="24" required class="input mt-2 font-mono text-xs"><%= stepsJson %></textarea>

                <details class="mt-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-xs text-slate-600">
                    <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">Ver formato y ejemplo</summary>
                    <pre class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap">[
  {"id":"bienvenida","type":"message","text":"Hola...","next":"p1"},
  {"id":"p1","type":"question","text":"¿Eres pensionado?","buttons":[
    {"id":"SI","title":"Sí"},{"id":"NO","title":"No"}
  ],"next":{"SI":"p2","NO":"cierre"}},
  {"id":"cierre","type":"end","text":"Gracias...","links":[],"handoff":false}
]</pre>
                    <p class="mt-2">En <code>end</code>, <code>links</code> puede llevar hasta 3 enlaces con <code>label</code> y <code>url</code>.</p>
                </details>
            </section>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <button class="btn btn--primary">Guardar flujo</button>
                <a href="/admin/ai/guided-flows" class="btn btn--secondary">Cancelar</a>
            </div>
        </form>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
